* sg13g2-bandgap -- bandgap_core PEX one-point sanity probe (issue #272).
* GENERATED by layout/bandgap_core/probe/make_probe_netlist.py from
* layout/bandgap_core/bandgap_core.pex.spice -- do not edit by hand;
* edit the generator and re-run it (`--check` verifies this file is
* current against the committed extraction).
*
* NOT an evidence record. One operating point at
* corner=typ temp=27C vdd=3.30V, whose job is to make
* layout/README.md's "One-point probe" table re-runnable. The five
* *-pex experiments' own PVT grids against this extraction are #275.
*
* Extracted devices re-encoded: 6 pfet, 257 rppd.
* Wire-parasitic cards copied verbatim: 833.
* Bipolars (XQ1-XQ3) spliced from design/netlist/bandgap_core.spice --
* the curated sg13g2 deck does not recognise npn13G2, so they are not
* in the extraction; see layout/README.md 'Permanent blockers'.
* Merged tap net T001|T003|T007|T015|T031|T063|T127|TN0 renamed to
* tn0_merged ('|' is not a legal ngspice node name).

.lib "@PDK@/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerHBT.lib" hbt_typ
.lib "@PDK@/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib" mos_tt
.lib "@PDK@/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib" res_typ

.options temp=27 tnom=27

Vvdd vdd 0 dc 3.30
Vvss vss 0 dc 0

* FIXTURE 1 -- open-loop mirror bias (no error amplifier in this cell):
* a diode-connected replica carrying a 5 uA reference sets the shared
* gate net, exactly as sim/core-open-loop-bias-pex does.
XM0 fb fb vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
Ibias fb vss dc 5u

* FIXTURE 2 -- per-leg ammeter; FIXTURE 3 -- body tied to the ideal vdd
* rather than through its own body hub leg (that leg carries no current
* this probe measures). Drain/source hub nodes are each leg's own, read
* off its extracted card.
XM1 vdd__t0 fb m1s vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10U l=1U as=4P ad=4P ps=20.8U pd=20.8U ng=1 m=1
Vm1 m1s sns1__t0 dc 0
XM2 vdd__t2 fb m2s vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=9U l=1U as=3.6P ad=3.6P ps=18.8U pd=18.8U ng=1 m=1
Vm2 m2s sns2__t0 dc 0
XM3 vdd__t4 fb m3s vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1U l=1U as=0.4P ad=0.4P ps=2.8U pd=2.8U ng=1 m=1
Vm3 m3s sns2__t1 dc 0
XM4 vdd__t6 fb m4s vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=8U l=1U as=3.2P ad=3.2P ps=16.8U pd=16.8U ng=1 m=1
Vm4 m4s vref__t0 dc 0
XM5 vdd__t10 fb m5s vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1U l=1U as=0.4P ad=0.4P ps=2.8U pd=2.8U ng=1 m=1
Vm5 m5s vref__t2 dc 0
XM6 vdd__t11 fb m6s vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=1U l=1U as=0.4P ad=0.4P ps=2.8U pd=2.8U ng=1 m=1
Vm6 m6s vref__t3 dc 0

* Extracted rppd devices -- the 255 ladder units plus R1 (l=37.2u) and
* R2 (l=82.7u), each at its own extracted geometry. The extraction's
* `r=` field is klt's sheet estimate, not a subckt parameter, and is a
* lower bound on a short segment (klayout-tools#2652) -- dropped here;
* the real r3_cmc compact model computes the value from w/l.
